@150000 = ~Ooh? What's this? Kachiko's whispery sword? Spooky!~
@150001 = ~What? Wants to makes it more whispery? But needs a scroll of screaming banshees. Nasty stuff, oh yes! Also one of shadowy doors! And you gots neither, boss.~
@150002 = ~What? Wants to makes it more whispery? You gots the screaming scroll already but needs the shadow door one!~
@150003 = ~What? Wants to makes it more whispery? You gots the shadow door scroll, but needs a scroll of screaming banshees too! Nasty stuff, oh yes!~
@150004 = ~But, could be spoooookier, Cespenar thinks. You has the needed scrolls, just needs 10,000 gold. You likes?~
@150005 = ~No? Too spooky? Cespenar understands, yes. Well, if you change your mind...~